---
import testimonial1 from '../../assets/images/testimonial1.jpg';
import testimonial2 from '../../assets/images/testimonial2.jpg';
---

<section
	class="overflow-hidden bg-[#111827] px-6 py-24 lg:px-[120px]"
	style="background-image: radial-gradient(158.45% 146.94% at 100% 0%, rgba(124,58,237,0.15) 0%, rgba(124,58,237,0) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg, #081738 0%, #2b1f63 100%);"
>
	<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]">
		<h2 class="text-center text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-white md:text-[44px]">From Families Like Yours</h2>
		<div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
			<article class="rounded-3xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-8 md:p-10">
				<div class="mb-4">
					<svg width="32" height="36" viewBox="0 0 32 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 15.6875C0 11.0258 3.77578 7.25 8.4375 7.25H9C10.2445 7.25 11.25 8.25547 11.25 9.5C11.25 10.7445 10.2445 11.75 9 11.75H8.4375C6.26484 11.75 4.5 13.5148 4.5 15.6875V16.25H9C11.482 16.25 13.5 18.268 13.5 20.75V25.25C13.5 27.732 11.482 29.75 9 29.75H4.5C2.01797 29.75 0 27.732 0 25.25V23V20.75V15.6875ZM18 15.6875C18 11.0258 21.7758 7.25 26.4375 7.25H27C28.2445 7.25 29.25 8.25547 29.25 9.5C29.25 10.7445 28.2445 11.75 27 11.75H26.4375C24.2648 11.75 22.5 13.5148 22.5 15.6875V16.25H27C29.482 16.25 31.5 18.268 31.5 20.75V25.25C31.5 27.732 29.482 29.75 27 29.75H22.5C20.018 29.75 18 27.732 18 25.25V23V20.75V15.6875Z" fill="#0084FF"/></svg>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base italic leading-[26px] text-[#f0f4ff]">"For years we felt like we were failing our son because traditional school wasn't working. The insights here helped us realize he wasn't broken—he was just different. Today, he's thriving in a home-learning environment that honors his intensity."</p>
				<div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					<img src={testimonial1.src} alt="Sarah Jenkins" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0084ff] object-cover" />
					<div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Sarah Jenkins</p><p class="text-xs text-[#c7d5fe]">Parent of two 2e boys</p></div>
				</div>
			</article>
			<article class="rounded-3xl border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] p-8 md:p-10">
				<div class="mb-4">
					<svg width="32" height="36" viewBox="0 0 32 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 15.6875C0 11.0258 3.77578 7.25 8.4375 7.25H9C10.2445 7.25 11.25 8.25547 11.25 9.5C11.25 10.7445 10.2445 11.75 9 11.75H8.4375C6.26484 11.75 4.5 13.5148 4.5 15.6875V16.25H9C11.482 16.25 13.5 18.268 13.5 20.75V25.25C13.5 27.732 11.482 29.75 9 29.75H4.5C2.01797 29.75 0 27.732 0 25.25V23V20.75V15.6875ZM18 15.6875C18 11.0258 21.7758 7.25 26.4375 7.25H27C28.2445 7.25 29.25 8.25547 29.25 9.5C29.25 10.7445 28.2445 11.75 27 11.75H26.4375C24.2648 11.75 22.5 13.5148 22.5 15.6875V16.25H27C29.482 16.25 31.5 18.268 31.5 20.75V25.25C31.5 27.732 29.482 29.75 27 29.75H22.5C20.018 29.75 18 27.732 18 25.25V23V20.75V15.6875Z" fill="#7C3AED"/></svg>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base italic leading-[26px] text-[#f0f4ff]">"Finding a community that understands the unique combination of high IQ and executive dysfunction was a game changer. We've gone from constant frustration to celebrating small wins and building a world that works for our daughter's brain."</p>
				<div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
					<img src={testimonial2.src} alt="Mark Thompson" class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full border-2 border-[#7c3aed] object-cover" />
					<div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Mark Thompson</p><p class="text-xs text-[#c7d5fe]">Homeschooling Dad</p></div>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
